  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">A Small Nation in the Turmoil of the Second World War (2013), published by Leuven University Press, has been cited 2 times. Beyond that, it has been downloaded 2,902 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">A Small Nation in the Turmoil of the Second World War by Herman Van der Wee was published by Leuven University Press in 2013. Conceptually, the work connects to Political science, World War II, Economic history, Political economy and Development economics.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records 2 citations. Citations peaked in 2013 with 1 citing works. Notable citing venues include The Journal of Economic History and Cambridge University Press eBooks. The citing works include 1 journal article and 1 book chapter. They come from 2 countries, led by the United Kingdom and Japan.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It has been downloaded 2,902 times via OAPEN.</p>",
